{"id":706496,"title":"[Immersive Vehicles] Sphase Vehicle Mashup Pack (SVMP)","summary":"A bunch of random vehicles with fun customization and functionalities.","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"\u003eOne of those oldschool Flans style packs, where you can find anything from a cutting-edge hypercar to a Cold War army truck. Literally.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CgEWmV9G7EA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOld Trailers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"spoiler\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mKQr0IehBTk?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fCryTV7ytfY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDESCRIPTION:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px\"\u003eSVMP is a content pack for the\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eImmersive Vehicles\u003c/a\u003e mod. It does not work standalone. It is a passion project. At large, I am a developer for Craftspeed, another content pack. This is just the side gig. Therefore I do not have all the time in the world to work on this, so expect a garbage update schedule. This pack consists of vehicles I personally like enough, to spend the time bringing them into Minecraft.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePACK CONTENTS:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"\u003eThis pack contains vehicles that I personally like, and want to do, so there is no theme as such. I do my best to include some customization, where possible too. I mostly like old, little-known, and quite frankly, poorly made cars, so those, you can expect the most of. However, I do occasionally feel like making something nice and shiny, or something big and sturdy.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"\u003eNote, that as I develop this pack purely for self enjoyment, \u003cspan style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"\u003eit is unlikely that I will take a request\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;(unless you hit me with something I like).\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"spoiler\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eDual Ghia 6.4L\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eOpel Campo\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eIkarus 260\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eRenault M\u0026eacute;gane Coupe Mk 1\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eAM General M939 Series\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eVolvo 480\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eToyota Celica (T180) (Voxel)\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eWiesmann GT MF5\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eTVR Sagaris\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eAston Martin Valkyrie\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003ePuma GTB S2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eMiura X8\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eGSM Flamingo\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003ePanzerkampfwagen V Panther Ausf\u0026uuml;hrung A\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eVolkswagen Typ 82 K\u0026uuml;belwagen\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eNissan Leopard F30\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eMazda Cosmo HB\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eSuzuki Swift 1988\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eVolkswagen Transporter T6\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eMoncetti Citadel\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCOMPATIBILITY:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px\"\u003eSince SVMP doesn't have many custom wheels, steering wheels, seats, engines and light bars, those specific parts are compatible with their equivalents from \u003ca href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mts-iv-immersive-pokers-garage\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ePoker's Garage\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-vehicles-craftspeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eCraftspeed\u003c/a\u003e, both in scale and functionality.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"font-size:14px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/521/828/allcars.png\" alt=\"all the vehicles of the original release\" width=\"1920\" height=\"393\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFAQ:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"spoiler\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- How to install the pack?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYou need a Minecraft Forge installation, just put it in mods folder. It requires Immersive Vehicles already in to run!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Please update it to newer versions of Minecraft!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSVMP is merely an addon to Immersive Vehicles. If it won't be updated to newer MC versions, SVMP won't be either.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Can I use SVMP on my server?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf it's a private server, yes. If it's a public one, you must ask me for first, not only because of permissions, but also because I'd love to visit! (Sphase#1753 via Discord, or @MikeMiner01 via Twitter)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e-\u0026nbsp;My car does not move, help!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYou might need to turn the engine on, put fuel in the car, or a bunch of other things. For further information, see the Immersive Vehicles mod page, or read the manual provided in the Immersive Vehicles mod itself.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- When will you release an update?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis is a passion project of mine, and in terms of priority, it falls behind another pack's development I'm part of, so the update schedule will likely be very inconsistent, so...\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;beats me honestly\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e-\u0026nbsp;How can I open the doors/hood on the TVR Sagaris/Aston Martin Valkyrie?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePlease see the images section of this page, there you will find the locations of the buttons/latches (true to life).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- How do I use the trailer?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAttach the \"Tow Hitch\" part to either the T6, or the Campo, back up to the trailer and click the \"Trailer Hookup\" button on the panel. Click the trailer's ramps to fold them down, then drive onto it with your car facing forwards. Once that's done, fold the ramps back up, and get into the towing car. Click the \"Trailer Bed\" button on the panel. To detach the towed car and the trailer, do this process in reverse order. IMPORTANT: Do not attach the trailer to the car while the ramps are folded down.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- How do I shoot with the Panther?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFirst, open the rear turret hatch, and put ammunition in the tank. Then get in the turret seat, and press the MTS Switch Gun button (\"v\" by default). Move the turret with the mouse and fire with the \"Space\" button. You can not shoot again, until the gun has reloaded, you will hear an audio clue when it does so.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","game":"minecraft","type":"Mods","urls":{"curseforge":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iv-mts-sphase-vehicle-mashup-pack-svmp","project":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iv-mts-sphase-vehicle-mashup-pack-svmp"},"thumbnail":"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1001/857/256/256/638521751645258877.png","created_at":"2022-11-24T09:12:06.303Z","downloads":{"monthly":0,"total":153381},"license":"","donate":"","categories":["Player Transport","Addons","Technology"],"members":[{"title":"Owner","username":"Sph4se","id":102539763}],"links":[],"files":[{"id":7937036,"url":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iv-mts-sphase-vehicle-mashup-pack-svmp/files/7937036","display":"SVMP3.7.3 - 1.16+ (1.21.1 neoforge patch)","name":"SVMP3.7.3 1.16+.jar","type":"release","version":"1.16.5","filesize":33892649,"versions":["Client","1.16.5","1.20.1","Forge","1.21.1","1.18.2","1.19.